    "name": "Parable Academy",
    "steam_appid": 3626300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parable Academy is a 2.5D tag team fighter with only one attack button. A Fabled curse has swept the world... ordinary teens have begun transforming into characters from their favorite stories. In order to keep these young people safe from their own curses, a university was set up - Parable Academy for Fabled Youths! Can these students survive the constant attacks from literature's greatest villains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/a8e72addd4da700df1c3f96bb77f9267.poster.avif?t=1749992165\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/a8e72addd4da700df1c3f96bb77f9267.webm?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/a8e72addd4da700df1c3f96bb77f9267.mp4?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple movement controls and a single button to use for all attacks, Parable Academy is incredibly easy for newcomers to pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the attack button with a direction to use your fighters' special moves, or hold the button for longer to unleash powerful Supercharge attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/61680fa718530185776f8e9c600530e3.poster.avif?t=1749992165\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/61680fa718530185776f8e9c600530e3.webm?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/61680fa718530185776f8e9c600530e3.mp4?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 playable fighters from classic fiction to choose from at launch, you'll have the opportunity to master plenty of unique playstyles!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice</strong> uses a variety of tools including the Vorpal Sword, a flamingo croquet mallet, and a mad teacup barrage to perform strong bread and butter  (or perhaps,  bread-and-butterfly) combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Creature</strong> harnesses the power of lightning to stun opponents, and comes alive with his devastating throws!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Wendy</strong>, you'll believe you can fly with bonus air mobility. Grab foes' shadows to drag them across the screen, and clap your hands to summon fairies that carry opponents away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Willie</strong> can play a silly symphony on the opponent with his powerful ranged attacks including steam whistles, music notes, and stretchy arms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Dorothy</strong>'s Silver Shoes to execute precision teleportation, and wear the Golden Cap to call limited-use favors from the Winged Monkeys!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Gatsby</strong>, pop some corks to temporarily buff your mobility and change the properties of certain attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And more to come!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2120dec7e083549fb49c608b59529888.poster.avif?t=1749992165\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2120dec7e083549fb49c608b59529888.webm?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2120dec7e083549fb49c608b59529888.mp4?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your tag meter by attacking opponents. You can use your meter to tag at any time, even tagging mid-combo to chain multiple characters' attacks together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can use your tag meter while under attack to bring in a teammate and punish the opponent - but take care that you don't get multiple fighters trapped in the enemy's moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three fighters per team, there's no limits to the team optimizations you can hone!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parable Academy is a 2.5D tag team fighter with only one attack button. A Fabled curse has swept the world... ordinary teens have begun transforming into characters from their favorite stories. In order to keep these young people safe from their own curses, a university was set up - Parable Academy for Fabled Youths! Can these students survive the constant attacks from literature's greatest villains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/a8e72addd4da700df1c3f96bb77f9267.poster.avif?t=1749992165\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/a8e72addd4da700df1c3f96bb77f9267.webm?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/a8e72addd4da700df1c3f96bb77f9267.mp4?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple movement controls and a single button to use for all attacks, Parable Academy is incredibly easy for newcomers to pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the attack button with a direction to use your fighters' special moves, or hold the button for longer to unleash powerful Supercharge attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/61680fa718530185776f8e9c600530e3.poster.avif?t=1749992165\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/61680fa718530185776f8e9c600530e3.webm?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/61680fa718530185776f8e9c600530e3.mp4?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 playable fighters from classic fiction to choose from at launch, you'll have the opportunity to master plenty of unique playstyles!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice</strong> uses a variety of tools including the Vorpal Sword, a flamingo croquet mallet, and a mad teacup barrage to perform strong bread and butter  (or perhaps,  bread-and-butterfly) combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Creature</strong> harnesses the power of lightning to stun opponents, and comes alive with his devastating throws!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Wendy</strong>, you'll believe you can fly with bonus air mobility. Grab foes' shadows to drag them across the screen, and clap your hands to summon fairies that carry opponents away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Willie</strong> can play a silly symphony on the opponent with his powerful ranged attacks including steam whistles, music notes, and stretchy arms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Dorothy</strong>'s Silver Shoes to execute precision teleportation, and wear the Golden Cap to call limited-use favors from the Winged Monkeys!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Gatsby</strong>, pop some corks to temporarily buff your mobility and change the properties of certain attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And more to come!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2120dec7e083549fb49c608b59529888.poster.avif?t=1749992165\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2120dec7e083549fb49c608b59529888.webm?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2120dec7e083549fb49c608b59529888.mp4?t=1749992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your tag meter by attacking opponents. You can use your meter to tag at any time, even tagging mid-combo to chain multiple characters' attacks together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can use your tag meter while under attack to bring in a teammate and punish the opponent - but take care that you don't get multiple fighters trapped in the enemy's moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three fighters per team, there's no limits to the team optimizations you can hone!</p>",
    "short_description": "A one-button fighter that\u2019ll have you hitting the books! Legends from classic fiction clash in 3 vs 3 tag battles. Unlock fighters in single-player skill challenges, then put your combos to the test in online play. Simple enough for newcomers to pick up, but plenty of strategic depth to be found!",
